        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wamwilili Mosi nindi, Ichi dinu wukumona chinukumwila Fwaro; wakayumbaku nachikasa chaŋovu hohu, wakayite muna chakuyitemuna mwituŋa dindi nachikasa chaŋovu hohu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nzambi wahosheli naMosi, wamwilili nindi, Ami yami Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chinadimwekesheli nikudi Abarahama, nikudi Isaka, nikudi Yakoba, nadimwekesheli nejina dami daNzambi Chinaweji, ilaŋa hinadimwekesheli nejina dami daYehovaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Natiyaŋani nawu chitiyaŋenu chami, naminakayinka ituŋa daKenani, dodituŋa dazonkamenuwu, mwomu mwashakaminuwu chawenyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Natiyi nichakwabawu anyana kaIsarela anakakejuwu aEjipitu muwuduŋu. Ami na anuki chitiyaŋenu chami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi wukuhoshanawanyana kaIsarela, neyi, Yehova nindi, Ami yami Yehova, kuyiteliya waEjipitu nakayifumishaku, nakayamwina kuwuduŋu wawu, nakayi kúulana chikasa chakwolola, nakusompesha kwakweni kweneni hohu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nakayitambula mwakekala antu ami, ninami nakekala Nzambi yenu; mwakelukanenu, ami yami Yehova Nzambi yenu wayifumishili mukusenda yiteliya waEjipitu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakayitwala mwituŋa dinasanyikilili Abarahama, naIsaka, naYakoba nami nakayinkadu, nakayinkadu denu, dakekala wuswana wenu; ami yami Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mosi wayilejeli anyana kaIsarela mwenomu, ilaŋa wena kwawu kumutiyilila Mosi nehi, muloŋa munyichima yawu hijinakumi dehi, nawuduŋu wawu wawukatu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wamwilili Mosi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nindi, Iŋilaku wuhoshi namwanta waEjipitu Fwaro, neyi, Yileki anyana kaIsarela akafumi mwituŋa deyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mosiwahosheli kumesu aYehova, nindi, Yowe! anyana kaIsarela wowu ákubula kuntiyilila, indi Fwaro wakantiya mwakanyi, ami ni kweti kanwa kawudima! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wahosheli naMosi naAroni, wayinkeli mudimu wakuhoshanawanyana kaIsarela, niwakuhosha namwanta waEjipitu, Fwaro, wakuyifumisha anyana kaIsarela mwituŋa daEjipitu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiyenu atulamba akumavumu awu; anyana kaRubeni amayala, wedi waIsarela, iwu Hanoki, iwu Palu, iwu Hezeroni, iwu Karami, diyi yisaka yaRubeni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyana kaSimeyona amayala, iwu Yemuweli, iwu Yamini, iwu Ohadi, iwu Yakini, iwu Zohari, iwu Shawulu mwana kamumbanda wamuKenani, diyi yisaka yaSimeyona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiyenu majina awanyana kaLevi amayala mwomwavwalikililuwu, iwu Gereshoni, iwu Kohati, iwu Merari. Nyaka yahandiliyi Levi yashi kili munyaka nkulakaji namakumi asatu nanyaka yitanu nayiyedi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyana kaGereshoni amayala, iwu Libini, iwu Shimeyi, mwomwekala yisaka yawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyana kaKohati amayala, iwu Amarama, iwu Izihari, iwu Heberoni, iwu Uziyeli. Nyaka yahandiliyi Kohati yashi kili munyaka nkulakaji namakumi asatu nayisatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyana kaMerari amayala, iwu Mahili, iwu Mushi. Diyi yisaka yawaLevi mwavwali kililuwu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amarama wasumbwili Yokebedi muhelatata yindi, wamuvweleli niAroni niMosi. Nyaka yahandiliyi Amarama yashi kili munyaka nkulakajinamakumi asatu nanyaka yitanu nayiyedi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyana kaIzihari amayala, iwu Kora, iwu Nefweŋi, iwu Zikiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyana kaUziyeli amayala, iwu Mishayeli, iwu Elizafwana, iwu Sitiru.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aroni wasumbwili Elisheba, mwana kaAminadabi, muhela Nahashoni; yena wamuvweleli iwu Nadabi, iwu Abihu, iwu Eleyazari, iwu Itamari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyana kaKora amayala, iwu Asiru, iwu Elekana, iwu Abiyasafwi; diyiyisaka yawaKora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwana kaAroni Eleyazari hadi anyana kaPutiyeli awambanda wasumbwiluhu wumu; yena wamuvweleli Fwinehasi. Awadiwu atulamba ahadi aLevi mwomwekala yisaka yawu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
